1
00:00:00,724 --> 00:00:03,054
(Raj:)Well, that's that.

2
00:00:03,059 --> 00:00:04,659
(Raj:)The room's compromised.

3
00:00:04,661 --> 00:00:06,491
(Raj:)They'll have to change
all the filters,

4
00:00:06,496 --> 00:00:09,466
(Raj:)probably shut it down
for weeks.

5
00:00:09,466 --> 00:00:12,196
(Howard:)You were right. Go ahead,
call Building Services.

6
00:00:14,471 --> 00:00:15,371
(Howard:)Tell them it was my fault.
No, we're both to blame.

7
00:00:15,371 --> 00:00:16,271
(Leonard:)You know, let me take
the heat on this one.

8
00:00:16,273 --> 00:00:17,443
KOOTHRAPPALI:
Yeah, just leave me out of it.

9
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:19,340
(Raj:)You know if they come here
and see crap everywhere,

10
00:00:19,342 --> 00:00:21,672
(Raj:)they're just gonna
blame the Indian guy.

11
00:00:21,678 --> 00:00:23,748
(ringtone playing)

12
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:28,620
(Leonard(on phone):)Hey. I'm sorry,
we're still here.

13
00:00:28,618 --> 00:00:30,218
(Leonard(on phone):)Is everything okay?

14
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,450
(Penny:)It's kind of boring.

15
00:00:31,454 --> 00:00:33,224
(Penny:)Although it did get exciting
for a minute

16
00:00:33,223 --> 00:00:35,423
(Penny:)when Amy inhaled a wool ball.

17
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,330
(Penny:)How much longer
do you think you'll be?

18
00:00:38,328 --> 00:00:39,428
(Leonard:)I don't know.

19
00:00:39,429 --> 00:00:40,659
(Leonard:)There's still
a bird in here.

20
00:00:40,664 --> 00:00:42,934
(Leonard:)We are gonna get in
a ton of trouble.

21
00:00:42,933 --> 00:00:44,903
(Penny:)Honey, it's Christmas Eve.
Who even knows you're in there?

22
00:00:44,901 --> 00:00:46,901
(Leonard:)No, our names are on
the sign-in sheet.

23
00:00:46,903 --> 00:00:48,403
(Penny:)So erase them and walk out.

24
00:00:48,405 --> 00:00:50,475
(Leonard:)I can't do that.

25
00:00:50,473 --> 00:00:51,473
(Howard:)Can't do what?

26
00:00:51,474 --> 00:00:52,604
(Leonard:)She says take our names

27
00:00:52,609 --> 00:00:54,239
(Leonard:)off the sign-in sheet
and leave.

28
00:00:54,244 --> 00:00:56,414
(chuckles):
We can't do that.
Yeah.

29
00:00:58,882 --> 00:01:02,282
ALL: ♪ Jingle bells, jingle
bells, jingle all the way ♪

